// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/ext_power.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>

#define Base        0
#define Media       1
#define Nav         2
#define Mouse       3
#define Sym         4
#define Num         5
#define Fun         6
#define Button      7
#define Game        8
#define Gameplus    9

&mt {
    quick-tap-ms = <100>;
    global-quick-tap;
    flavor = "tap-preferred";
    tapping-term-ms = <170>;
};

&lt {
    tapping-term-ms = <240>;
    flavor = "balanced";
    quick-tap-ms = <150>;
};

/ {
    behaviors {
        hm: homerow_mods {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MODS";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            global-quick-tap;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };
    };

    combos { compatible = "zmk,combos"; };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        Base {
            label = "Base";
            bindings = <
             &kp Q  &kp W       &kp E        &kp R         &kp T                         &kp Y                        &kp U        &kp I        &kp O       &kp P
             &kp A  &hm LALT S  &hm LCTRL D  &hm LSHIFT F  &kp G                         &kp H                        &hm RSHFT J  &hm RCTRL K  &hm RALT L  &kp SEMICOLON
&lt 3 ENTER  &kp Z  &kp X       &kp C        &kp V         &kp B                         &kp N                        &kp M        &kp COMMA    &kp DOT     &kp SLASH      &lt 4 ENTER
                                &lt 1 DEL    &lt 2 SPACE   &mt LEFT_CONTROL BACKSPACE    &mt RIGHT_CONTROL BACKSPACE  &lt 3 BSPC   &lt 4 C
            >;
        };

        Lower {
            label = "Nav";
            bindings = <
         &kp EXCLAMATION  &kp AT_SIGN  &kp HASH   &kp DOLLAR  &kp PERCENT    &kp CARET  &kp AMPERSAND  &kp ASTERISK  &kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS  &kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS
         &kp N1           &kp N2       &kp N3     &kp N4      &kp N5         &kp N6     &kp N7         &kp N8        &kp N9                &kp N0
&kp ESC  &kp UNDERSCORE   &kp EQUAL    &kp MINUS  &kp PLUS    &trans         &trans     &trans         &trans        &trans                &trans                 &kp ESC
                                       &trans     &trans      &trans         &trans     &trans         &kp NUMBER_0
            >;
        };

        Raise {
            label = "Sym";
            bindings = <
         &kp LEFT_BRACKET  &kp RIGHT_BRACKET  &kp LESS_THAN         &kp GREATER_THAN       &trans           &trans     &kp HOME  &kp UP    &kp PAGE_UP    &kp PRINTSCREEN
         &kp LEFT_BRACE    &kp RIGHT_BRACE    &kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS  &kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS  &kp BACKSLASH    &trans     &kp LEFT  &kp DOWN  &kp RIGHT      &kp C_PAUSE
&kp TAB  &kp PIPE          &kp GRAVE          &kp TILDE             &kp DOUBLE_QUOTES      &kp SQT          &kp UNDER  &kp END   &kp INS   &kp PAGE_DOWN  &kp CLCK         &kp TAB
                                              &trans                &trans                 &trans           &trans     &trans    &trans
            >;
        };

        Fun {
            label = "Fun";
            bindings = <
        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &kp F11  &kp F12
        &kp F1  &kp F2  &kp F3  &kp F4  &kp F5    &kp F6  &kp F7  &kp F8  &kp F9   &kp F10
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans   &trans   &trans
                        &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };

        Button {
            label = "Button";
            bindings = <
             &bt BT_CLR         &trans    &trans     &trans      &bt BT_SEL 0    &trans      &trans            &trans      &bootloader  &trans
             &kp LGUI           &kp LALT  &kp LCTRL  &kp LSHIFT  &bt BT_SEL 1    &trans      &kp RSHIFT        &kp RCTRL   &kp RALT     &kp RGUI
&bootloader  &ext_power EP_TOG  &trans    &trans     &trans      &bt BT_SEL 2    &trans      &trans            &trans      &trans       &trans    &trans
                                          &trans     &trans      &trans          &kp C_PREV  &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE  &kp C_NEXT
            >;
        };

        Gaming {
            bindings = <
            &trans  &trans  &trans     &trans        &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
            &kp A   &kp S   &kp D      &kp F         &mo 6     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&kp ESCAPE  &trans  &trans  &trans     &trans        &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                            &kp LCTRL  &kp LEFT_ALT  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;

            label = "Gaming";
        };

        Gaming+ {
            bindings = <
         &kp NUMBER_1  &kp NUMBER_2  &kp NUMBER_3  &kp NUMBER_4  &kp NUMBER_5    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &kp LC(RA(DEL))
         &kp L         &kp O         &kp Y         &kp K         &kp G           &kp F5  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&kp TAB  &to 0         &trans        &trans        &kp NUMBER_6  &kp NUMBER_7    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans           &kp LA(F4)
                                     &kp J         &kp I         &kp M           &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;

            label = "Gaming+";
        };

        layer_7 {
            bindings = <
        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                        &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };
    };
};
